run_ca()
Prgm
(c)Lets user choose CA
(c)then run

Local n,i,x,y,p,q,r
local key,row,new

(c)Set graph screen native res
RclGDB lib/ntvres

(c)Update rule names here
(c)in list 'can'

Dialog
 Title "Choose Rule"
 DropDown "Rule",can,n
EndDialog

If ok=0:Goto end

newList(158)->new
newList(158)->row

(c) Single-cell
(c) initial condition
1->row[79]
PxlOn 1.79

(c) Run rules
Lbl run

0->key

For y,2,75
 For x,2,157
  getKey()->key
  If key!=0:Goto save
  (c)get p, q & r
  row[x-1]->p
  row[x]->q
  row[x+1]->r

  (c)select rule
  If n=1 Then
   (c) rule 22
   mod(p+q+r+p*q*r, 2)->i
  ElseIf n=2 Then
   (c) rule 30
   mod(p+q+r+q*r, 2)->i
  ElseIf n=3
   (c) rule 110
   mod(q*r*(1+p)+q+r, 2)->i
  EndIf

  (c)turn pixel on
  If i=1 Then
   PxlOn y,x
   1->new[x]
  EndIf
 EndFor
 new->row
 newList(158)->new
EndFor

(c)Save
Lbl save
Pause
savepic()

Lbl end
EndPrgm
